\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces Singularity-formation accounting. Contact forces a unit normalized shell crossing and therefore exposes a target-aligned source. Repeated scales select a persistent source cell. A null ledger entry contradicts alignment, a divergent-price entry contradicts the sole finite physical budget, and a finite-price entry activates ordered successors and recurrence. Only the target projection of the generated saturation algebra enters finite-depth viability; survival at every depth constructs the singularity mechanism.}}{72}{figure.19}\protected@file@percent }
